Dear Colleagues,

I am pleased to announce significant enhancements to our benefits program for FY2026. These investments reflect our commitment to supporting you and your families across all dimensions of well-being.

## What's New for 2026

### Mental Health Support

We are significantly expanding our mental health benefits:

| Enhancement | Details |
|-------------|---------|
| Therapy Coverage | Increased from 20 to 52 sessions per year |
| In-Network Providers | Expanded network by 40% |
| Digital Therapy | Talkspace premium subscription included |
| EAP Sessions | Increased from 6 to 12 sessions |
| Mental Health Days | 3 dedicated days (no documentation required) |

**Investment:** $1.2 million annually

### Family Building Benefits

New fertility and family building support:

| Benefit | Coverage |
|---------|----------|
| Fertility Treatment | Up to $25,000 lifetime |
| Egg/Sperm Freezing | Up to $10,000 |
| Surrogacy Support | Up to $15,000 |
| Adoption Assistance | Increased to $15,000 |
| Parental Leave | Extended to 16 weeks (all parents) |

**Investment:** $800,000 annually

### Student Loan Assistance

New student loan repayment benefit:

| Benefit | Details |
|---------|---------|
| Annual Contribution | Up to $3,000 per year |
| Lifetime Maximum | $15,000 |
| Eligibility | All employees after 1 year |
| Administration | Through Gradifi platform |

**Investment:** $1.5 million annually

### Sabbatical Program

Launching July 2026 for long-tenured employees:

| Tenure | Sabbatical Benefit |
|--------|-------------------|
| 7 years | 4 weeks paid |
| 10 years | 6 weeks paid |
| 15 years | 8 weeks paid |
| 20+ years | 12 weeks paid |

**Investment:** $500,000 annually

